<div class="actions">
<a class="button primary" href="https://apps.microsoft.com/detail/9MSPKZ7CZ3W1">Get it from Microsoft Store</a>
<a class="button" href={base + 'guide/'}>Read the installation guide</a>
</div>
<p>Moving from the standalone edition? Read the guide before removing your old copy.</p>
</Layout>
